        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8479, Single Cylinder Retro Wilshire Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis front door lock features the graduated styling that is associated with the Art-Deco design aesthetic, making this modish deadbolt a must have for heavy duty security with a contemporary twist. After all, there is no reason that something functional can't be fashionable as well. The Wilshire Single Cylinder Deadbolt is available in a huge array of stunning finishes. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Wilshire Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Wilshire Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
