                "description": "This front door lock features the graduated styling that is associated with the Art-Deco design aesthetic, making this modish deadbolt a must have for heavy duty security with a contemporary twist. After all, there is no reason that something functional can't be fashionable as well. The Wilshire Single Cylinder Deadbolt is available in a huge array of stunning finishes. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior.",
